  "result": "Perfect! \u2705 All 317 tests pass (20 new VAT summary tests + 24 overdue tests + 273 existing).\n\n**`src/reports.js` updated with VAT summary:**\n- `vatSummary(invoices)` \u2014 Aggregates VAT by rate across issued/paid invoices\n\n**Function behavior:**\n- Filters invoices with status 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid'\n- For each line, calculates base amount (after line discount)\n- Groups by VAT rate\n- Returns array sorted by rate descending (high to low)\n- Each entry: `{ rate, base, vat }`\n\n**Key calculations:**\n- Line discount = roundCents(lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent / 100)\n- Base = lineTotal - lineDiscount (sum per rate)\n- VAT = roundCents(base \u00d7 rate / 100) (sum per rate)\n- Applies banker's rounding (half to even) via roundCents()\n- Accounts for explicit and tier-based discounts\n\n**Test coverage (20 new tests):**\n- Empty and single-line invoices\n- Multiple rates in one invoice\n- Sorting by rate descending\n- Excludes draft, includes issued/partially_paid/paid\n- Line-level and tier discounts\n- Multiple invoices and customers\n- Zero VAT rates\n- Multiple lines with same rate\n- Field validation and immutability\n- Calculation correctness with banker's rounding\n\nFeature complete and ready to ship.",
